From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:20:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 04/14] Add category menus and Move To in ALL mode

Each ALL category gets the native three-dots menu: mark as read, mute, rename,
delete, and sorting with two new options, unread on top and group by team.
Move To in a channel's menu now lists the ALL categories instead of the team's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
